    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR5f0021-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-h" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">Outer Chapters</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">Bào Pǔzǐ said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">There was a Master Huái Bīng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">who deplored the wandering and instability of the Zhōu dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">and lamented the virtuous ministers' hardships of spitting out food in order to immediately receive visitors.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">He relinquished fertile lands to the rich and powerful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">and personally tilled barren fields.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">He kept secret the six extraordinary arts in his bag,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">and held fine jades without revealing them.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">His tranquil sounds were unheard by anyone,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">his brilliant talents were unseen by the world.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">He turned his back on the splendor of noble gates,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">and maintained tranquility in his humble home.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">He cut off footsteps from the gates of the wealthy Jīn and Zhāng families,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">and nurtured vastness in the dwelling of a recluse.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">He considered glory and prominence to be misfortune,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">and regarded jade and silk as mere grass and earth.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">He held aloft spiritual standards in the heavens,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5f0021_tls_001-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-11-10T02:09:30.665+09:00">uniquely defying the present and following antiquity.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
